{"seq":1,"slug":"coupon-stack-eligibility-mutual-exclusion","title":"叠加资格、互斥与优先级规则建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/coupon-stack-eligibility-mutual-exclusion","wordCount":3179,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"叠加资格-互斥与优先级规则建模\">叠加资格、互斥与优先级规则建模</h1><p>优惠券系统最容易被低估的部分不是发券，而是<strong>结算时刻的规则求解</strong>：购物车里躺着 3 张券、平台在做满减、支付渠道还有立减，系统必须在几百毫秒内给出唯一、可复现、可审计的折扣结果。人写营销规则时用的是「这个能用、那个不能叠加」的自然语言；机器需要的是资格谓词、互斥图和全序优先级三样东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-能否叠加-拆成资格-互斥-优先级三层\">核心概念：把「能否叠加」拆成资格、互斥、优先级三层</h2><p>「A 券和 B 券不能一起用」这句话里混了三个正交的问题，工程上必须分开建模，否则规则一多就必然产生漏洞。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>建模对象</th>\n<th>典型失效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>资格（Eligibility）</strong></td>\n<td>这张券对<strong>这个购物车</strong>是否可用？</td>\n<td>谓词（predicate），无状态布尔函数</td>\n<td>把「不满足」和「被排除」混为一谈，导致错误提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>互斥（Mutual exclusion）</strong></td>\n<td>多张可用券之间哪些<strong>不能共存</strong>？</td>\n<td>冲突图（conflict graph），无向边</td>\n<td>漏建一条边 → 重复折扣 → 薅羊毛入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>优先级（Priority）</strong></td>\n<td>可行的券组合里，<strong>选哪一组、按什么顺序算</strong>？</td>\n<td>全序 + 目标函数</td>\n<td>顺序不确定 → 同一订单两次算价不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层是串联的：资格先筛出候选集，互斥定义候选集上的可行子集族，优先级在可行子集族里挑最优解。把它们压成一条 if-else 链是最常见的反模式——规则数超过十几个后，人工维护的 if-else 必然自相矛盾，且无法证明「没有漏排除」。</p>\n<p>资格层的关键区分是<strong>准入失败（ineligible）<strong>与</strong>被排除（excluded）</strong>：前者是购物车不满足券的门槛（未达最低金额、非目标 SKU），后者是券本身可用、但因叠加规则被更高优先级的券挤掉。给用户的前端文案、日志、反作弊信号三者都不同；混为「不可用」会在客服与风控两条线上同时丢信息。</p>\n<p>Shopify 的折扣模型是工业界参照：折扣按<strong>类别（discount class）<strong>划分（订单级 / 商品级 / 运费级），是否可组合由 <code>combinesWith</code> 上按类别的 allow/deny 标志决定（<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/DiscountCodeBasic\">Shopify Admin GraphQL <code>DiscountCodeBasic</code></a>）。它把互斥建在</strong>类别</strong>而非<strong>单券</strong>上：同类别默认互斥，跨类别按配置放开。这是最省心的起步设计，代价是表达力受限——需要「A 券和 B 券互斥但各自都能和 C 券叠加」这种细粒度时，类别模型就不够用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资格判定的谓词模型\">资格判定的谓词模型</h2><p>一张券的资格条件本质是一个合取范式：所有条件同时满足才准入。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(p, c) = \\bigwedge_{f \\in F_p} f(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5494em;vertical-align:-1.4994em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是券，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是购物车上下文，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该券的条件谓词集合。工程上应把谓词按<strong>作用域</strong>分层，因为不同作用域的证据来源不同、缓存策略不同、失败原因也不同。</p>\n<p><strong>商品作用域</strong>（SKU、类目、品牌、标签、排除清单）有一条来自平台政策的硬规则：<strong>排除优先于包含</strong>。Google Merchant Center 的促销规范写明，若一个过滤器排除了某商品而另一个包含它，「该商品将被排除在该促销之外」（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/2906014\">Google Merchant Center promotions</a>）。这不是产品倾向，而是防薅羊毛的必需语义——包含清单总会被枚举不全，排除清单是唯一的兜底闸门。该规范还规定：同一属性内多取值是 OR、跨属性是 AND，活动适用性与商品适用性被设为<strong>互斥二选一</strong>。头部平台主动砍掉表达力换取可判定性，自建引擎应接受同样权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>购物车作用域</strong>（最低金额、最低件数、指定品类件数）的门槛额与折扣额计算基数必须一致：若门槛按含税小计判、折扣按不含税小计算，边界上会出现「刚好达标但折后为负」的组合，这是薅羊毛的经典入口。</p>\n<p><strong>用户作用域</strong>（人群分层、首单、会员等级、地区）：<code>appliesOncePerCustomer</code>（每人一次）与 <code>usageLimit</code>（总次数上限）必须分开存——前者是<strong>身份维度</strong>约束，后者是<strong>容量维度</strong>约束；多账号作弊攻击的是前者，预算护栏守的是后者。<strong>时间与渠道作用域</strong>（生效窗口、配送渠道、兑换渠道）构成准入的最后一道筛选。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[购物车上下文 c] --&gt; B{商品作用域谓词}&#10;  B --&gt;|排除优先命中| X[申请被排除]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C{购物车作用域谓词}&#10;  C --&gt;|门槛不达标| Y[准入失败]&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D{用户作用域谓词}&#10;  D --&gt;|一次/总量已用尽| Y&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E{时间与渠道谓词}&#10;  E --&gt;|窗口外| Y&#10;  E --&gt;|通过| F[进入候选集]&#10;  F --&gt; G[互斥图求解]&#10;  G --&gt; H[优先级选优]&#10;  H --&gt; I[金额分配与落账]\">graph TD\n  A[购物车上下文 c] --&gt; B{商品作用域谓词}\n  B --&gt;|排除优先命中| X[申请被排除]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C{购物车作用域谓词}\n  C --&gt;|门槛不达标| Y[准入失败]\n  C --&gt;|通过| D{用户作用域谓词}\n  D --&gt;|一次/总量已用尽| Y\n  D --&gt;|通过| E{时间与渠道谓词}\n  E --&gt;|窗口外| Y\n  E --&gt;|通过| F[进入候选集]\n  F --&gt; G[互斥图求解]\n  G --&gt; H[优先级选优]\n  H --&gt; I[金额分配与落账]</pre><p>谓词必须是<strong>纯函数</strong>：只读上下文、无副作用、不做 I/O。凡涉及用量的地方（已用次数、剩余预算），应在求值前一次性冻结为快照注入上下文，而非在谓词里现查数据库——否则同一订单两次求值会读到不同用量，破坏可复现性。<code>asyncUsageCount</code> 这类最终一致计数字段的存在（见上引 Shopify 文档）正说明工业系统接受「计数有微小延迟」，因此<strong>最终防线必须落在互斥与幂等上，而不是落在计数精度上</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互斥关系的建模-冲突图-冲突对与冲突类\">互斥关系的建模：冲突图、冲突对与冲突类</h2><p>把候选券当作图的顶点，两张券不能共存则连一条无向边，得到<strong>冲突图</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = (V, E_c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。可行组合就是图中的独立集。这个抽象的好处是：冲突检测、求解、审计三件事都变成图上的标准操作。</p>\n<p>边的来源有三类，必须分开生成存储，因为<strong>变更频率与责任人不同</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>隐式边（类别级）</strong>：同类别默认互斥，对应 Shopify 的 <code>discountClasses</code> 语义，作者改类别时自动生成。</li>\n<li><strong>显式边（券对级）</strong>：规则作者点名的「A 与 B 不叠加」，可变性最高、最容易漏配。</li>\n<li><strong>派生边（业务级）</strong>：由治理策略推导，如「同一预算池来源的券最多命中 1 张」，通常由预算引擎反向注入。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>隐式边与显式边应合并成一张<strong>规范化冲突矩阵</strong>并做闭包检查：若规则说「A 与 B 互斥」「B 与 C 互斥」，而引擎按类别放开 A 与 C 的叠加，作者能否预料 A 与 C 会同时生效？多数事故就出在这种传递性没被显式确认的地方。发布前的冲突检测应把每一条<strong>新出现的</strong>共现对列成人工确认清单，而非只校验作者写下的那几对。</p>\n<p>冲突图有一个可判定性事实：<strong>求解最大折扣组合是 NP-hard 的</strong>。目标函数是最大化总折扣、约束是独立集，等价于最大权独立集问题，一般图上无多项式最优解。工程做法分三档：候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{|V|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个子集取最优（绝大多数真实购物车的规模）；候选数中等时按优先级贪心构造可行解，再对「前 k 张」做有界回溯；候选数很大时（大促会员日叠加场）直接<strong>限制结构</strong>——强制类别内互斥、类别间只允许线性链式叠加，把问题退化成排序即可求解。第一档是必须有的正确性基线：只有能在小规模上枚举出精确解，才有资格说贪心的近似策略「偏差可接受」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级与结算顺序-为什么顺序比选择更危险\">优先级与结算顺序：为什么顺序比选择更危险</h2><p>选出可行的券集合之后还有第二个决策：<strong>按什么顺序应用</strong>。很多人以为顺序只影响展示，实际它直接改变应付金额。</p>\n<p>对多个百分比折扣，顺序<strong>无关</strong>：连续作用于同一基数时结果是连乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_n = B_0 \\prod_{i=1}^{n} (1 - r_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，交换次序不改变乘积。但当<strong>百分比与固定额混合</strong>时顺序就变得关键：设基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_0 = 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>，折扣为「减 20%」与「减 $10」，先百分比后固定额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 \\times 0.8 - 10 = 70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span></span></span></span></span>，先固定额后百分比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(100 - 10) \\times 0.8 = 72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span>。同样的两张券，用户实际少付 $2。这不是舍入误差，而是<strong>规则定义了多少钱</strong>，因此优先级必须是引擎的<strong>显式一等公民</strong>。参照 Shopify 的披露方式：折扣类别的组合能力通过 <code>combinesWith</code> 显式配置，而该对象上<strong>没有</strong>公开的优先级/排序字段（同上引文档），结算顺序由平台内部按类别规定——平台把它当作不应暴露的实现约束；自建引擎时反而必须写进契约，因为商户会问「为什么这次算出来是 70 不是 72」。</p>\n<p>优先级排序应遵循一组<strong>稳定且可解释</strong>的键，依次比较：是否作用于运费 → 是否订单级 → 优先级数值 → 券 ID（最终决胜）。最后那条决胜键不是洁癖：<strong>没有全序，就没有可复现性</strong>。</p>\n<p>金额分配有两条硬约束：其一是<strong>折扣不得超过可折基数</strong>（折扣额须按作用域摊回行项，每行累计折扣不得使单价为负：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall l \\in I:\\ 0 \\le \\sum_{p \\in S} a_{p,l} \\le q_l \\cdot u_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；其二是<strong>分配残差必须守恒</strong>（摊分金额之和须精确等于券面折扣，且以最小货币单位（ISO 4217 minor unit，如分）为整数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{l \\in I} a_{p,l} = d_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。多行摊分常用「按比例摊分 + 最大余额法」消除残差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则编译与冲突检测-让引擎能在发布前自证\">规则编译与冲突检测：让引擎能在发布前自证</h2><p>规则从自然语言到可执行谓词，中间需要一个<strong>编译层</strong>，否则谓词散落在业务代码里，无法静态分析。可用的形态是把每张券编译成规则对象，字段分四组：<code>scope</code>（作用域与基数）、<code>predicate</code>（资格谓词）、<code>exclusion</code>（显式互斥边）、<code>priority</code>（排序键）。这与 Shopify（<code>combinesWith</code> / <code>discountClasses</code> / <code>appliesOncePerCustomer</code> / <code>minimumRequirement</code>）和 Google Merchant Center（<code>all_products</code> / <code>specific_products</code> / <code>store_code_inclusion</code> / <code>redemption_channel</code>）的字段划分一致，说明它是被多个平台独立收敛到的结构。</p>\n<p>编译完成后，发布前跑三类静态检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>冲突检测</strong></td>\n<td>找出能被同时命中的互斥对</td>\n<td>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u, v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 中无连边但存在购物车使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(u,c) \\wedge E(v,c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>不可达检测</strong></td>\n<td>找出永远不会生效的券</td>\n<td>若某券与所有更高优先级券都冲突且自身优先级不更高，则为死规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>不变量检测</strong></td>\n<td>防止折后为负或超发</td>\n<td>断言摊分后每行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，断言总量不超过预算池余额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「不可达检测」最容易被跳过却最该做：规则写多后必然出现互相屏蔽的券，这类死规则会静静躺在库里，等某个配置漂移把它激活。<strong>冲突检测必须用生成器而非穷举</strong>——购物车空间太大，正确做法是让规则作者为每个作用域声明取值域，检测器在取值域的笛卡尔积上采样求解，而非随机走订单流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>「能否叠加」要拆成<strong>资格、互斥、优先级</strong>三层：资格是无状态谓词，互斥是冲突图上的边，优先级是可行独立集上的全序。三者失败模式完全不同，混成 if-else 必然失控。</li>\n<li>资格谓词按商品 / 购物车 / 用户 / 时间渠道分层，必须采纳<strong>排除优先于包含</strong>语义；<code>appliesOncePerCustomer</code>（身份维度）与 <code>usageLimit</code>（容量维度）是两条独立防线，前者才是多账号作弊的攻击面。</li>\n<li>互斥边分为隐式类别边、显式券对边、派生业务边；求解最优组合等价于最大权独立集，NP-hard，生产中靠「小规模精确枚举 + 中规模贪心回溯 + 大规模限制结构」三档策略。</li>\n<li>优先级直接决定金额（百分比与固定额混合时顺序改变应付额），必须显式建模并保证<strong>全序 + 决胜键</strong>。</li>\n<li>金额分配有两条不可让步的约束：每行折扣不超过其基数、摊分残差以最小货币单位守恒。</li>\n<li>将「资格 → 互斥 → 优先级 → 分配」做成<strong>一次求值返回完整决策</strong>（命中券、排除券及原因、应用顺序、每行摊分额），让每次结算留下可复算的决策轨迹。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>叠加规则的工程目标不是「把这一次算对」，而是让每次结算都输出一份可复算的决策轨迹。有这份轨迹，预算护栏与滥用响应（见 <code>../4_response-budget-guardrail-ops/INDEX.md</code>）才有稳定输入；检测侧的图信号（见 <code>../3_abuse-detection-graph-signals/INDEX.md</code>）才能与规则侧对齐口径。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"叠加资格、互斥与优先级规则建模","id":"叠加资格-互斥与优先级规则建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把「能否叠加」拆成资格、互斥、优先级三层","id":"核心概念-把-能否叠加-拆成资格-互斥-优先级三层"},{"level":2,"text":"资格判定的谓词模型","id":"资格判定的谓词模型"},{"level":2,"text":"互斥关系的建模：冲突图、冲突对与冲突类","id":"互斥关系的建模-冲突图-冲突对与冲突类"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级与结算顺序：为什么顺序比选择更危险","id":"优先级与结算顺序-为什么顺序比选择更危险"},{"level":2,"text":"规则编译与冲突检测：让引擎能在发布前自证","id":"规则编译与冲突检测-让引擎能在发布前自证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滥用损失归因与度量口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-abuse-loss-measurement"},"next":{"title":"促销预算账本与原子扣减机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/promo-budget-ledger-atomic-decrement"}}